  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "packages/ workspaces (7)",
      "items": [
        "exif-hound-core — sole desktop import surface; facades over all other packages",
        "investigation-archive — ProjectStore, Drizzle schema, images/ + data/data.db layout",
        "Worker scripts live in exif-hound-core; they import middleware only inside the worker bundle (not full core)",
        "ocr-middleware, image-forensics-middleware, workbench-workflow — WorkbenchRunService"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Primary path",
      "items": [
        "Upload → core worker URL → worker thread → middleware → postMessage → core enrich → archive",
        "Workbench UI → core → workflow runner → OCR + forensics → archive tables",
        "Evidence UI → core index builder over investigation-archive rows"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Provider ports (swap without touching UI)",
      "items": [
        "Each package exposes a middleware class + injectable port(s); core facades mirror the same shape",
        "ExifMiddleware (ExifTagLoader), ImageProcessingMiddleware (ImageCodec + ImageEnhancer), OcrMiddleware (OcrWorkerFactory)",
        "ImageForensicsMiddleware (MetadataReader, ImageStructureReader, LocalOcrRecognizer)",
        "investigation-archive: DatabaseEngineProvider + FsPort; core: ReverseGeocodingProvider → Nominatim",
        "Configure via ExifHoundCoreOptions / MiddlewareNamespaceOptions or configureReverseGeocodingProvider",
        "Desktop UI libs (Leaflet, @xyflow/react) stay in apps/exif-hound-desktop — swap via package deps"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Trust boundaries",
      "items": [
        "Desktop app must not import middleware packages directly (scan:domain-imports)",
        "Rust HTTPS allowlists for Nominatim, tiles, remote images; FS scoped to project roots",
        "sql.js WASM DB serialized to disk via TauriFsPort"
      ]
    }
  ]
